\f0\fs24 \cf0 PROJECT OVERVIEW\
\
UEFA has commissioned the creation of a new internal animated Season\'92s Greetings film to be distributed via email during the festive period. The animation will run approximately 45\'9660 seconds and should deliver a warm, hopeful, and distinctly European festive message that connects football culture with seasonal traditions.\
\
The creative challenge is to produce a film that feels emotionally rich, cinematic, and handcrafted while remaining achievable within a leaner production budget than previous years. Rather than relying heavily on archive match footage, the proposal focuses on building original visual worlds inspired by iconic UEFA moments, legendary players, and European festive iconography through stylised animation and handcrafted miniature aesthetics.\
\
The presentation explores two distinct creative routes:\
\
CONCEPT ONE \'97 THE BALL BOY\
\
A heartfelt stop-motion-inspired journey following a tiny football-themed Christmas bauble character through a magical European Christmas market filled with UEFA-inspired festive objects, handcrafted football folklore, bakery stalls, ornaments, and toy-like environments. The story culminates beneath a giant illuminated Christmas tree where the character finds its place among a larger festive family.\
\
CONCEPT TWO \'97 THE UEFA GINGERBREAD FACTORY\
\
A playful handcrafted festive bakery inspired by the symmetry and miniature filmmaking language of Fantastic Mr Fox and Wes Anderson. Iconic football actions are transformed into simplified mechanical baking sequences that produce UEFA-themed Christmas gingerbread and European festive treats, culminating in a final handcrafted \'93UEFA\'94 gingerbread reveal beside Father Christmas\'92s chair.\
\
Both concepts are designed to:\
- feel warm, festive, and hopeful\
- celebrate European culture through football and seasonal traditions\
- avoid over-reliance on archive footage\
- embrace handcrafted tactile aesthetics\
- be achievable through a combination of miniature-inspired design, stylised animation, and modern AI-assisted image development workflows\
\
The overall visual ambition is cinematic, premium, and emotionally resonant while remaining production-conscious and scalable within the proposed budget framework.}